  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at part heading for Adm 611) #10364, eff 7-1-13; ss by #13708, eff 7-29-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Adm 600)",
  "inScheme": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/scheme",
